<div id="player-tips" class="player-tips">
  <button type="button" class="player-tips-trigger" aria-label="Daily Faceoff tips" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="player-dfo-tips" aria-describedby="player-dfo-tips">📎</button>
  <div id="player-dfo-tips" class="player-tips-panel" role="tooltip" hidden>
    <h2>Daily Faceoff tips</h2>
    <p>Tap the Daily Faceoff logo to turn priority sorting on or off. Your filters stay active. Select Playing Today or Playing Tomorrow to narrow the list.</p>
    <p><span class="player-tips-badge player-tips-f">F</span><span class="player-tips-badge player-tips-d">D</span><strong>Skaters:</strong> PP1 first, then PP2, then everyone else. Within each group, players follow your selected sorting column and direction.</p>
    <p><span class="player-tips-badge player-tips-g">G</span><strong>Goalies:</strong> Confirmed → Likely → Unconfirmed → no starting status → Not starting. Within each group, goalies follow your selected sorting column and direction. Odds and G1/G2 do not determine this order.</p>
    <p><strong>Sorting and ranks:</strong> Tap a column heading to sort. The number beside a player is their place in the current filtered list. Mixed lists keep skaters before goalies when Daily Faceoff sorting is on.</p>
    <p><strong>ECFHL*:</strong> Projected fantasy points per game, blending Fantrax projections and actual performance using the league’s configured weights. Selecting another stats period changes the stats shown.</p>
  </div>
</div>
